# INACTIVE — do not rename to _redirects unless explicitly approved.
# Copy these lines into public/_redirects (merged with any existing rules)
# OR use netlify.toml Option A in optional-domain-redirects.md (recommended).
#
# Place BEFORE any SPA catch-all rules. These rules only apply to the hosts
# listed below on THIS Netlify site. They do NOT affect my.winprofx.com or
# partner.winprofx.com (separate sites/DNS).

